hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1590","Ali bin Khashram told us, Ibn Uyaynah told us, on the authority of Yahya bin Saeed, and Mis’ar, they heard Adi bin Thabit say: I heard Al-Baraa bin He is single and says: I heard the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, reciting “figs and olives” at the evening meal of the afterlife. I have never heard a better recitation than him, may God bless him and grant him peace. “Peace be upon him”"
